abstract: >
  behavioral-fsm-benchmark extends FSM-Bench-20 with behavioral oracles, guard
  semantics, gold reference FSMs, test-suite agreement, robustness perturbations,
  and multi-run reproducibility instrumentation. Bootstrap skeleton only; no
  experimental data yet.
